  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/667/667-11.htm",
  "statuteText": "667:11 Printing. –\n\nThe secretary of state shall prepare and cause to be printed ballots for all elections under this chapter. He shall also prepare all necessary forms for declarations of candidacy and furnish the same in reasonable quantities to the town clerks. Said ballots and forms shall be printed and delivered at the expense of the state."
}
